{"id":5,"date":"2026-10-05T07:05:19","date_gmt":"2026-10-05T07:05:19","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/portofolioadamsyahputra.local\/?page_id=5"},"modified":"2026-10-05T08:36:08","modified_gmt":"2026-10-05T08:36:08","slug":"home","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"http:\/\/portofolioadamsyahputra.local\/","title":{"rendered":"Home"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Halo, Saya Adam Syahputra<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">S1 Teknik Informatika<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Lulusan Teknik Informatika dengan kombinasi keahlian teknis IT Support, pengolahan sistem web, serta pengalaman operasional dan layanan pelanggan di industri F&amp;B<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-fe48e5de wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-align-center wp-element-button\" href=\"mailto:adamsyahputra03@gmail.com\">Hubungi Saya<\/a><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"http:\/\/portofolioadamsyahputra.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/CV_Adam_Syahputra_Hybrid.pdf\">Unduh CV<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"><div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"682\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http:\/\/portofolioadamsyahputra.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Foto-4x6-2-682x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10\" style=\"aspect-ratio:0.6660311407689863;width:275px;height:auto\" srcset=\"http:\/\/portofolioadamsyahputra.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Foto-4x6-2-682x1024.jpg 682w, http:\/\/portofolioadamsyahputra.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Foto-4x6-2-200x300.jpg 200w, http:\/\/portofolioadamsyahputra.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Foto-4x6-2-768x1154.jpg 768w, http:\/\/portofolioadamsyahputra.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/Foto-4x6-2.jpg 788w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 682px) 100vw, 682px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" id=\"tentang-saya\"><strong>Tentang Saya<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Lulusan Teknik Informatika dan Teknik Elektronika dengan pengalaman operasional yang kuat dari staf hingga dipercaya sebagai Kepala Toko di industri F&amp;B. Memiliki kombinasi keahlian teknis dalam pemeliharaan sistem\/hardware, analisis data stok, serta kemampuan manajerial seperti pengelolaan tim dan layanan pelanggan. Terbiasa menyelesaikan masalah secara terstruktur, adaptif terhadap lingkungan dinamis, dan siap memberikan kontribusi nyata baik di bidang IT Support, Administrasi Sistem, maupun Manajemen Operasional.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Keahlian IT &amp; Teknis:<\/strong> Berpengalaman dalam <em>troubleshooting<\/em> hardware &amp; OS, dasar pembuat aplikasi web (PHP, MySQL), serta merancang sistem pencatatan stok digital.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Kepemimpinan &amp; Operasional:<\/strong> Berpengalaman sebagai Kepala Toko dalam mengelola tim, penyusunan <em>shift<\/em>, rekapitulasi <em>cash flow<\/em>, <em>stock opname<\/em>, dan standar pelayanan (<em>customer service<\/em>).<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Etos Kerja:<\/strong> Terbiasa dengan ritme kerja dinamis\/sistem <em>shift<\/em>, berorientasi pada ketelitian data, dan adaptif dalam menyelesaikan kendala di lapangan.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" id=\"pendidikan\"><strong>Pendidikan<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>S1 Teknik Informatika<\/strong> <em>(2022 \u2013 2026)<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Universitas Indraprasta PGRI (UNINDRA)<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Teknik Elektronika<\/strong> <em>(2017 \u2013 2021)<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">SMK Negeri 26 Jakarta<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" id=\"pengalaman\"><strong>Pengalaman Kerja<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">IT &amp; Teknis<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Warkop Tikungan<\/strong> \u2014 <em>Staf Pendukung Operasional (Kuliah Kerja Praktik)<\/em><\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Sept 2025 \u2013 Jan 2026<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Merancang sistem pencatatan stok digital dan menyusun laporan alur barang harian berbasis data.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>PT Datindo Infonet Prima<\/strong> \u2014 <em>Teknisi Gudang (PKL)<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">2020 \u2013 2021<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Melakukan pemeliharaan perangkat teknis, pengelolaan inventaris, dan distribusi perangkat secara sistematis.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Proyek Pengembangan Web<\/strong> (Perkuliahan)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Membangun aplikasi web monitoring jadwal tugas menggunakan PHP, MySQL, dan AJAX.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">F&amp;B<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Warkop Tikungan<\/strong> \u2014 <em>Kepala Toko &amp; Crew<\/em><\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Apr 2025 \u2013 Agst 2026<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Memimpin operasional outlet, menyusun <em>shift roster<\/em>, mengelola <em>cash flow<\/em> harian, <em>stock opname<\/em>, dan berkoordinasi dengan supplier<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Triple Market<\/strong> \u2014 <em>Bar &amp; Kitchen<\/em><\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Des 2023 \u2013 Des 2024<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Meracik menu sesuai SOP, menjaga kebersihan\/higienitas dapur, dan mengelola <em>prep-material<\/em> bahan baku.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Kopierte<\/strong> \u2014 <em>Junior Barista<\/em><\/h5>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Juni 2022 \u2013 Sept 2022<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Melayani penyajian kopi <em>espresso-based<\/em>, penanganan kasir\/QRIS, serta persiapan <em>opening\/closing<\/em> kedai.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" id=\"keahlian\"><strong>Keahlian<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-colum